Implement explicitly requested, authorized probes for proposed upstream configs. Bound time/output; redact credentials; clean up temporary clients/processes. Report schema/discovery errors distinctly from auth/connectivity failures. Acceptance: hanging/broken stdio and HTTP probes leave active runtime unchanged and no orphan processes; cross-owner probes denied.
